Dialogue: 7,0:10:08.97,0:10:13.90,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}七つの海を越えて
Dialogue: 7,0:10:13.90,0:10:18.39,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}遥かな冒険した
Dialogue: 7,0:10:18.70,0:10:23.18,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}これ以上はもう贅沢
Dialogue: 7,0:10:23.18,0:10:27.77,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}願いなら告げたあと
Dialogue: 7,0:10:28.35,0:10:33.09,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}梅雨空も過ぎ去った
Dialogue: 7,0:10:33.09,0:10:40.95,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}新しいページが開く
Dialogue: 7,0:10:43.21,0:10:48.48,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}大人になんてなれなくていい
Dialogue: 7,0:10:48.48,0:11:01.46,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}だって大切な宝物を忘れることでしょ
Dialogue: 7,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.58,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}そんなの嫌だ
Dialogue: 7,0:11:03.58,0:11:06.92,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}誰だって嫌だ
Dialogue: 7,0:11:06.92,0:11:13.57,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}だから必死に守ってゆくんだ
Dialogue: 7,0:11:13.57,0:11:19.58,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}このポケットに詰め
Dialogue: 7,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.58,OP - JP,,0,0,48,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}約束
Dialogue: 8,0:10:08.97,0:10:13.90,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}跨越七大洋
Dialogue: 8,0:10:13.90,0:10:18.39,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}历经遥远冒险
Dialogue: 8,0:10:18.70,0:10:23.18,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}此刻早已足矣
Dialogue: 8,0:10:23.18,0:10:27.77,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}许下心愿后
Dialogue: 8,0:10:28.35,0:10:33.09,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}连梅雨天空也随之放晴
Dialogue: 8,0:10:33.09,0:10:40.95,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}崭新的一页就此展开
Dialogue: 8,0:10:43.21,0:10:48.48,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}不必勉强成为大人
Dialogue: 8,0:10:48.48,0:11:01.46,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}因为那意味着遗忘珍贵的宝物
Dialogue: 8,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.58,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}我不要
Dialogue: 8,0:11:03.58,0:11:06.92,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}任谁都不会想要
Dialogue: 8,0:11:06.92,0:11:13.57,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}所以我要拼命守护下去
Dialogue: 8,0:11:13.57,0:11:19.58,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}将约定
Dialogue: 8,0:11:19.58,0:11:22.58,OP - CN,,0,0,5,,{\fad(200,350)\blur3\an7}塞进口袋
